================================================================================
roman1x.lisp, roman1y.lisp, roman1y.lisp
Similar to roman1.lisp, but these demonstrate that rules can be reordered w/o
consequence. Their rules are literally shuffled from roman1.lisp.

================================================================================
roman2.lisp
Ordered production system. Conditions of rules are simplified. Consequently, the
order is now significant.

================================================================================
roman3.lisp
Discrimination net. Rules arranged to minimize number of decisions.

